# design_system/

Shared UI tokens, theme, and reusable widgets (no business logic, never import `features/`).

Generated by `/foundation`. Typical layout after `--migrate-ds`:

```
design_system/
  theme/      # colors, typography, ThemeData (from config/themes or similar)
  widgets/    # shared buttons, cards, inputs (from lib/widgets/)
  modals/     # only when explicitly migrated (often feature-coupled)
```

Move remaining shared UI here when the rule of three applies.
